      435.92,
      295.31,
      498.8
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964, that theGovernment intends to acquire the following land/servitude*which is required for a public purpose.",
